<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Missouri Higher Ed, $24.35 mln.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Missouri Higher Ed, $24.35 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>MISSOURI HIGHER EDUCATION LOAN AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $24,350,000</p>
<p>STUDENT LOAN REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>Effective at 10:30 A.M. E.S.T., Tuesday, January 28, 1997</p>
